    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>tree-sitter-html: build the grammars to WebAssembly modules as well (new noarch tree-sitter-html-wasm, /usr/share/tree-sitter/wasm) and ship the grammar queries (new noarch tree-sitter-html-queries, /usr/share/tree-sitter/queries/&lt;grammar&gt;) for web-tree-sitter consumers such as opencode's highlighter. Supersedes sr#1378023, which had the wasm half only. Uses the %treesitter_wasm_* and %treesitter_queries_* macros from tree-sitter sr#1378101; nothing else changes.
INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together with sr#1378101 (tree-sitter) and the other tree-sitter-&lt;lang&gt; requests.</comment>
    <requestid>1378111</requestid>
  </revision>
